t `set_clear_button_enabled` to true for all of these, it makes sense for all of these filters.\r\nSame with the right icon, \"Search\" is a good default here.\r\n\r\nI think it also makes sense to use this in FileSystemDock, SceneTreeDock, GroupsEditor, ProjectManager, ConnectionsDock, ConnectDialog (nodes and methods), SpriteFramesEditor, ThemeItemImportTree, ScriptEditor `filter_methods` (the `filter_scripts` would need more work), EditorSettingsDialog, ProjectSettingsEditor, and TreeSortAndFilterBar. These could be done here or in another PR.\r\nOr maybe we can use TreeSortAndFilterBar instead?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#pullrequestreview-3352253702","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98667","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-18T00:28:35Z"},{"id":3363038029,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Ic-NN","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"96f35c07c86377e8cd8e639bb7ed52a80e118bb1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"CreateDialog has a `search_box->set_right_icon` that can be removed.\r\n\r\nThe GridMapEditor should also accept left/right inputs since it is a grid. But it is fine for now since just up/down is the current behavior.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98667#pullrequestreview-3363038029","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98667","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-21T23:07:28Z"},{"id":3742519544,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7fElD4",